(1, 'WELCOME TO CDO TUTOR!', 'We Are\nYour Teachers!', 'Kind friendly, dedicated professionals', 'We are licensed professional teachers who cater all levels and all subjects with excellent and quality services.', '5.5K+', 'Followers\nand growing', 'Licensed', 'Professional\nTeachers', 'All Levels', 'All Subjects\nCovered', 'Quality', 'Education You\nCan Trust', 'rwfdsa', 'fsdafeads', 'fiushafjnsaj', '', '', '', 'To provide good customer service satisfaction. Excellent learning that will nurture a child academicallyd working environments.', 'To become a nationally-recognized learning center and school with a hundred of excellence teachers and students.', 'Courageous\nDisciplined\nOptimistic\nTalented\nLimitless\nCourteous', 'espinosapaul810@gmail.comsss', '0926-113-8886wss', 'https://www.facebook.com/espinosapaul810/', '2026-08-03 12:18:17', '2026-09-03 01:26:16');
